        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 806 Solid Brass Oval  Rope Style Sliding Pocket Door Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor over 10 years, First Impressions has been designing and manufacturing beautiful custom decor for homes, right here is the U.S.A. They offer some of the most diverse and beautiful styles we carry. This Solid Brass oval shaped sliding pocket door flush pulls is of the finest quality offering both fashion and function. With its Rope design and oval shape, it's a beautiful yet classic piece for your home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-oval-beaded-flush-pull-fii-809\"><b>Oval Beaded Flush Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth:  13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth:  7/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/16\" (.170)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height:  3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width:  1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis flush pull is packaged with matching finish mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is  discontinued.</b> See available <a href=\"/collections/flush-pulls\">Recessed Pulls</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
